Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:02.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if money actually grew on trees?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:04.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One leaf could change everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:09.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At first, people would race
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:11.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to harvest a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.25,0:00:17.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then more trees bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.97,0:00:19.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Soon, cash is everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.25,0:00:25.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone can spend more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.05,0:00:27.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the shelves have not grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.25,0:00:34.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More money cannot instantly create
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.54,0:00:36.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,more bread, homes, or workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.25,0:00:42.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With the same goods and far more cash,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:43.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,prices could soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.25,0:00:50.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A mountain of banknotes might barely buy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.69,0:00:51.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a single loaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.25,0:00:58.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Real wealth comes from growing food,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:01.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,building homes, and delivering what people need.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.25,0:01:06.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even a millionaire could face an empty shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.94,0:01:08.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and go home hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.25,0:01:13.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you want this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:15.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell us: yes or no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Small,,0,0,0,,WHAT IF / MONEY TREES
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:48.00,Small,,0,0,0,,ILLUSTRATIVE SCENARIO — NOT A FORECAST
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:17.60,Title,,0,0,0,,WHAT IF MONEY\NGREW ON TREES?\N\NWOULD YOU WANT THIS WORLD?\N\NYES / NO
